type: dataset
title: "Sufi Shrines of Pakistan"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual (English/Urdu), schema-validated, open dataset of Sufi shrines
  and multi-faith sacred sites across Pakistan. Covers Muslim shrines (dargahs,
  mazars), Hindu temples (mandirs), and Sikh gurdwaras, with structured
  provenance tracking, a Frictionless Data Package descriptor, and a companion
  interactive web map. Built for Harvard computational humanities research.
